      "note": "One /invoke implementation: agent-core HttpToolGateway::invoke_verdict (typed InvokeResponse incl. approval_id, 4-send full-jitter retry). response-agent and detection-agent now use it; response-agent records a transport failure as an error with decision=null and stops the plan instead of fabricating a Deny; detection logs denials with the real reason. response-agent writes agent_checkpoints Final, so task/run streams fold a live checkpoint.",
